    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive Crazy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/b6094616eea512ceb624ce9695836cee.poster.avif?t=1755457555\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/b6094616eea512ceb624ce9695836cee.webm?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/b6094616eea512ceb624ce9695836cee.mp4?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go over 88 miles per hour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive Through Zombie Hordes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/00b77a5de6b7a36c29144503a4eae796.poster.avif?t=1755457555\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/00b77a5de6b7a36c29144503a4eae796.webm?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/00b77a5de6b7a36c29144503a4eae796.mp4?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash the zombies. Take them apart. Splash their blood everywhere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Vehicle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/04edc05bfa7fa67da5189064b4f5a79d.poster.avif?t=1755457555\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/04edc05bfa7fa67da5189064b4f5a79d.webm?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/04edc05bfa7fa67da5189064b4f5a79d.mp4?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your vehicle to drive faster and longer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive Even Faster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/00417647baa0834fd4631702b7438d49.poster.avif?t=1755457555\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/00417647baa0834fd4631702b7438d49.webm?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/00417647baa0834fd4631702b7438d49.mp4?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive till you reach the limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/f3ba4b5bdd1964053d2afbdd8dad7d4c.poster.avif?t=1755457555\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/f3ba4b5bdd1964053d2afbdd8dad7d4c.webm?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/f3ba4b5bdd1964053d2afbdd8dad7d4c.mp4?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through various obstacles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach the Destination</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/d8e140c20fa2ef4f14dba8598cc5fe7d.poster.avif?t=1755457555\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/d8e140c20fa2ef4f14dba8598cc5fe7d.webm?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823190/extras/d8e140c20fa2ef4f14dba8598cc5fe7d.mp4?t=1755457555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a gas station to refuel and continue the journey.</p>",
